 "one can", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 4, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "can", "name": "evaporated milk", "prep_note": "12 oz", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 5, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tsp", "name": "vanilla extract", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 6, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tsp", "name": "lemon", "prep_note": "zest", "is_optional": false}], "steps": ["Melt the sugar in a small pan over medium heat, without stirring, 5 min until amber. Pour into the base of a 7-inch round dish and tilt to coat.", "Whisk the yolks gently with the condensed milk, evaporated milk, vanilla and zest, stirring slowly so as not to make foam.", "Strain the custard through a fine sieve into the dish.", "Cover tightly with foil. Set the dish in a larger pan of hot water that reaches halfway up the sides.", "Bake at 325 F (160 C) for 50-60 min, until the center barely jiggles and a knife comes out clean.", "Cool, then chill at least 4 hours. Run a knife around the edge and invert onto a plate."]}, {"slug": "rogan-josh", "title": "Rogan Josh (Kashmiri Lamb Curry)", "cuisine": "Indian", "prep_time_min": 20, "cook_time_min": 90, "servings": 6, "spice_level": 3, "cookware": ["Dutch oven"], "notes": "Let the yogurt come to room temperature and stir it constantly as it goes in, or it splits.", "ingredients": [{"sort_order": 1, "quantity": 1.5, "unit": "lb", "name": "lamb shoulder", "prep_note": "edible meat weight; buy about 2 lb bone-in, in 2-inch pieces", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 2, "quantity": 3.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "mustard oil", "prep_note": "or ghee", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 3, "quantity": null, "unit": null, "name": "black cardamom", "prep_note": "2 pods", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 4, "quantity": 4.0, "unit": null, "name": "cardamom", "prep_note": "green pods, cracked", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 5, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "name": "cinnamon stick", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false