with sprouts, basil, lime and jalapeno."]}, {"slug": "bun-bo-hue", "title": "Bún Bò Huế (Spicy Beef and Lemongrass Noodle Soup)", "cuisine": "Vietnamese", "prep_time_min": 30, "cook_time_min": 150, "servings": 6, "spice_level": 3, "cookware": ["Pot"], "notes": "Bruise the lemongrass hard; its fragrance drives this broth.", "ingredients": [{"sort_order": 1, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "lb", "name": "beef shank", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 2, "quantity": 0.7, "unit": "lb", "name": "pork trotters", "prep_note": "edible weight; buy about 1.5 lb, cut in pieces", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 3, "quantity": 10.0, "unit": "cup", "name": "water", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 4, "quantity": null, "unit": null, "name": "lemongrass", "prep_note": "6 stalks, 4 bruised and tied, 2 minced", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 5, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "name": "yellow onion", "prep_note": "halved", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 6, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "shrimp paste", "prep_note": "dissolved in 1/2 cup cold water, settled, clear liquid used", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 7, "quantity": 3.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "fish sauce", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 8, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "rock sugar", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 9, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tsp", "name": "salt", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 10, "quantity": 3.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "vegetable oil", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 11, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "achiote paste", "prep_note": "or 1 tbsp annatto-infused oil", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 12, "quantity": 4.0, "unit": "clove", "name": "garlic", "prep_note": "minced", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 13, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "chili paste in oil", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 14, "quantity": 12.0, "unit": "oz", "name": "rice stick noodles", "prep_note": "thick round, dried, prepared per package directions", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 15, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "cup", "name": "bean sprouts", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 16, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": null, "name": "lime", "prep_note": "cut in wedges", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 17, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "cup", "name": "vietnamese coriander", "prep_note": "or mint, loosely packed", "is_optional": false}], "steps": ["Boil the shank and trotters in water to cover for 5 min. Drain and rinse.", "Return to the pot with the 10 cups water, onion and the 4 tied lemongrass stalks. Simmer 90 min, skimming, until the shank is tender. Remove the shank and slice when cool.", "Heat the oil in a small pan. Fry the minced lemongrass, garlic and achiote 2 min, until the oil turns deep red-orange. Stir in the chili paste.", "Scrape the chili oil into the broth. Add the clear shrimp-paste liquid, fish sauce, rock sugar and salt. Simmer 30 min more.", "Divide cooked noodles among bowls and top with sliced shank and a piece of trotter.", "Ladle the hot broth over. Serve with sprouts, lime and herbs."]}, {"slug": "bo-luc-lac", "title": "Bò Lúc Lắc (Shaking Beef)", "cuisine": "Vietnamese", "prep_time_min": 40, "cook_time_min": 10, "servings": 3, "spice_level": 0, "cookware": ["Wok"], "notes": "Sear the beef in batches; crowding steams it instead of browning.", "ingredients": [{"sort_order": 1, "quantity": 1.5, "unit": "lb", "name": "sirloin steak", "prep_note": "cut in 1-inch cubes", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 2, "quantity": 4.0, "unit": "clove", "name": "garlic", "prep_note": "minced, divided", "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 3, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "oyster sauce", "prep_note": null, "is_optional": false}, {"sort_order": 4, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tbsp", "name": "soy sauce", "prep_note": null, "